    889  f0ef							; --- Per-band ball gate (Phase 3): BandTab[row] $ff/$00 → ENABL ---
    890  f0ef							; Takes the slot of the per-band `lda Temp / sta COLUBK` (VBL writes
    891  f0ef							; COLUBK once now) — same position, +1c (7c gate vs 6c pair), PF2 shifts
