   1265  f202							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1266  f202							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1267  f202							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1268  f202							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1269  f202							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1270  f202							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1271  f202				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1272  f202							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
