   1353  f25f							; --- Physics: vy += GRAVITY (gravity), vy -= JetPower (jet thrust). ---
   1354  f25f							;     JetPower b7 = float flag (bugs #31): float frames add gravity
   1355  f25f							;     only — subtracting $80+ would blast the player upward.
   1356  f25f				   .Gravity
