   1641  f3cd							; UpdateEnemies — per-type live motion from RAM shadow (overscan).
   1642  f3cd							; E0: loop runs EVERY frame; each type carries its own speed gate (snake
   1643  f3cd							; ÷4 here; bat ungated, spider ÷8, tentacle ÷2/÷8, moth ÷2 in E1-E4).
   1644  f3cd							; Snake patrol: bounds are SYMMETRIC about the ROM spawn X (± SNAKE_PATROL =
   1645  f3cd							; one tile, user 2026-10-19 — see the constant): retreat a tile behind the
   1646  f3cd							; placement, come out a tile, repeat. The ROM dir names the side it comes OUT
   1647  f3cd							; on: the loader inverts a snake's live dir at room load (bank2 EnterRoomB2),
   1648  f3cd							; so the first move is the retreat into its wall. Ignores editor range_* per
   1649  f3cd							; user 2026-09-23. No wall collision.
