   1758  f45a		       b0 36		      bcs	.TentOut
   1759  f45c		       85 88		      sta	Temp	; Temp = candidate X (free in overscan)
   1760  f45e							; Same-column cull: committed X is always probe-clear, so a candidate in
   1761  f45e							; the same 4px column covers the same collision cells → result is known
   1762  f45e							; (C=0) and the full PlayerHitsMap swap/probe can be skipped.
   1763  f45e		       a5 88		      lda	Temp
