   2019  f556							; Y overlap: player [RoomY, +11] vs enemy [ActiveObjectY, +11] — exact
   2020  f556		       a5 81		      lda	RoomY
   2021  f558		       38		      sec
   2022  f559		       e5 b8		      sbc	ActiveObjectY
   2023  f55b		       18		      clc
