   2665  f807							; SOSkipTail — the rotation slot picked a DEAD enemy (or a taken key). It used
   2666  f807							; to draw nothing, so the survivor showed only every 2nd frame: kill the enemy
   2667  f807							; next to the miner and the MINER started flickering (user 2026-10-25), and a
   2668  f807							; two-enemy room flickered its survivor. Hand the slot on instead:
   2669  f807							;   1. the miner is here -> draw the miner (every frame once the enemy is gone);
   2670  f807							;   2. else the room's other enemy (index ^ 1) if it exists and is alive;
   2671  f807							;   3. else nothing.
   2672  f807							; Terminates: step 2 jumps into the live path only for a LIVE partner, and a
   2673  f807							; taken key can re-enter here only once per frame (its partner is then dead).
