   3864  fcb3							; LoseLifeBand — life path + respawn just above the water strip.
   3865  fcb3							; The shift MUST happen BEFORE LoseLife: its stay path tail-jumps DropArm,
   3866  fcb3							; which freezes RoomY as the drop destiny. Shifting after the call was dead
   3867  fcb3							; code — a water death respawned at the death Y (inside the strip, >= 125) and
   3868  fcb3							; the player died again on landing, unable to fly out (user report 2026-10-21).
   3869  fcb3							; The shift is one tile (spec: -= 12, not the whole band): the band check
   3870  fcb3							; tests the sprite ORIGIN (RoomY >= 115), so 115 -> 103 clears the strip.
   3871  fcb3							; Tail-jmps LoseLife (never returns here): its exhausted path rts straight to
   3872  fcb3							; CheckBandTouch.
