   4121  fdad							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   4122  fdad							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   4123  fdad							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF4 always
   4124  fdad							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   4125  fdad							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   4126  fdad							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
