   4411  fe90							; page for all 72 B — the passing +7 probe's exact cycle sum). Row colors
   4412  fe90							; per OBJ_* slot: type color x8 (matches EnemyColorTable /
   4413  fe90							; SelectActiveObject frame colors — no visual change for enemies/lamp/bomb);
   4414  fe90							; MINER slot = miner.png purple/pink/grey -> nearest NTSC $54/$4A/$08.
   4415  fe90							; NOTE: dark rooms no longer force grey objects — the frame-level $0A write
   4416  fe90							; is overridden per row (no budget for a dark skip flag; see .Line probe).
   4417  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
