   4644  ff4d							; floor max(RoomX-20,0)) — past the cap restarts at the eye, the
   4645  ff4d							; triangle-loop feel of the sweep (user: beam "moved way beyond the
   4646  ff4d							; limit"). RectCount = free scratch (LWC re-owns it for its row walk).
   4647  ff4d				   .LAdvStep
