   4755  ffe6							; (CheckMinerPickup arm / TallyWork step): `sta $1FF5` selects bank1, then the
   4756  ffe6							; jmp operand is fetched from bank1's image at the same PC (FoldIndirect
   4757  ffe6							; discipline). The bank1 body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) -> rts back to the
   4758  ffe6							; bank0 jsr. Ends $FFEB — $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill (F6 hotspot mirrors).
   4759  ffe6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
